VillagerTradeFix (Itamio port for Minecraft 1.20.1, Forge)

This mod is an unofficial full port of "VillagerTradeFix" by Globox1997
(https://github.com/Globox1997/VillagerTradeFix, MIT).

Original license: MIT (see LICENSE, preserved from the original project).

The original mod fixes villager trade abuse: villagers remember their
trades per job site (cycling job sites no longer resets trade offers,
via per-job NBT trade memory in the Villager mixin), reputation
discounts from trading are capped, and Hero of the Village discounts
are configurable.

All credit for the original concept, design, and logic goes to
Globox1997. This port was created by Itamio to bring the full original
logic to Minecraft 1.20.1 (Forge). Itamio does not take credit for
any of the original assets or logic.
